 method, and the resulting 80% bounds.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"rubricItem\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"resolver\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"severity\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"warning\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"summary\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"The resolver text and variables are clear, but the reasoning says the 2026-09-10 release date is only expected and should be rechecked, while the ledger target treats it as the resolution date.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"actionRequested\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Either cite the official Census release-calendar evidence supporting 2026-09-10, or keep the ledger date and explicitly flag the release-date uncertainty as a ledger-calendar caveat rather than a resolved fact.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"optionalSuggestions\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Add the 2024 U.S. ACS 1-year same-table value to historicalContext and demote California to an external benchmark.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Make the downside tail more concrete by quantifying what prior-year stagnation or subsidy-related churn would imply for the percentage point change.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"Check that all JSON fields continue to use percent units and one-decimal rounding after revising the prior and interval.\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"]}\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"}}\\\\\\\\n./records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-21/2026-07-21t01-39-25z-census-acs-broadband-subscription-65-plus-share-2025/pre_submit_review_command.json:10:    \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\"/Users/maxghenis/_worktrees/brier-aging-wave2/records/thesis-analyst/2026-07-21/2026-07-21t01