e target is Census ACS Detailed Table B28005, universe population in households, United States, 2025 ACS 1-year first print. The numerator is B28005_017E, 65 years and over, has a computer, with a broadband Internet subscription; the denominator is B28005_014E, total 65 years and over. The resolution source URL is the exact data.census.gov table page for ACSDT1Y2025.B28005.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"official.lookup\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"call\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Inspect Census API variable metadata for 2024 ACS 1-year B28005\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Fetched variable definitions: B28005 has 78 variables; B28005_014E is total 65 years and over; B28005_017E is 65 years and over with a computer and a broadband Internet subscription; B28005_001E is the total table population count.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"official.lookup\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"call\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Inspect Census data.census.gov 2023 ACS 5-year B28005 United States row as reference-class anchor\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Fetched United States 2023 ACS 5-year B28005 counts: total population in households 324,275,237; 65 years and over total 54,267,407; 65+ with broadband subscription 44,841,576; computed share 44,841,576 / 54,267,407 * 100 = 82.6 percent.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"official.lookup\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"call\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Inspect Census data.census.gov 2024 ACS 1-year B28005 California row for latest same-table high-adoption benchmark\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"result\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Fetched California 2024 ACS 1-year B28005 counts: total population in households 38,537,958; 65 years and over total 6,333,225; 65+ with broadband subscription 5,786,620; computed share 5,786,620 / 6,333,225 * 100 = 91.4 percent.\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"kind\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tool\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"official.lookup\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"call\\\\\\\":\